{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b9ea31866296c68de99136395a6a7f631abbe371ab6b5ad60ba848f238aef804",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56c6fd4f0c3071c5fbbfaa7d8efccd372539c9cff5ab747985a2a92130839c36",
      "text": "展翅高飞的小小挑战者们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df0ef4b05b4291955f690608ca326132c1962e984c2787fe87f9b11728d12c3",
      "text": "直央下定决心，今天一定要向母亲坦白自己想辞去演艺界的工作。\n可就在这时，他却收到了来自事务所的偶像邀请。\n另一边，得知直央收到邀请的志狼下了一个决心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000015:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000015:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56c6fd4f0c3071c5fbbfaa7d8efccd372539c9cff5ab747985a2a92130839c36",
      "text": "展翅高飞的小小挑战者们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d65c8efddfbf0f9bbd504ba1c0f70629e362f8bf9a11d14242f989812c2346b",
      "text": "电视台·走廊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfdc2079bb10615956a611cdd678e77bd4147fd740aa41d09292b93285854f0b",
      "text": "咦？妈妈在跟谁说话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4542fdd0d8cc6e485bbf95265ed9d78e3a0c947c75c72cbb1a9abd5f466bf9e",
      "text": "是电视台的人吗。\n虽然是张没见过的面孔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3b04bdd5cfbb37d532b4227b53daa09e0e2e37839c1a4984ded48cb82946eaf",
      "text": "妈、妈妈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e3a42b87d1f0dc273a43cc796aae9b9cbdb56d3db69c865c5f15cb9965d5fa4",
      "text": "哎呀，直央。来得正好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e6cd6a8714baa80a2498d6dba88401bf89d53d918037c498987525dbaea1e5",
      "text": "这位是叫315 Production的\n偶像事务所的制作人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fec44ad352857941ef5758c98340b5ef7d3dd40fa383040a84829b6d99b2610",
      "text": "初、初次见面，我是冈村直央。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef11f57815572788ca71f669fca464cc058c57d934710a5b1999604fe8326724",
      "text": "那个，制作人，\n为什么要跟我妈妈说话呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a66ede9f4b4fce20baedd738a4631b67faa8983a93eb17d4a23973af28c85b1",
      "text": "这位制作人啊，说是来发掘直央当偶像的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:089457626c0c73bc0273c7531c0af5fbebaf1b4962fcaf2ce06f174e64a5ddbb",
      "text": "哎……\n我、我去当偶像！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd34b4dc0105e0f190e2ba917c207cde65dd60fe276b00621266927df7bc7cf",
      "text": "啊哈哈……是开玩笑……的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7b3fe56b5c2fa8cb860d80ab53e742e25affa247647ab93ffcdebfd30424814",
      "text": "是真的哦！\n妈妈都打算答应了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a3dfe18375bf7152ca46056e1606a98315ddeca707161fde515619d3bda6563",
      "text": "哎……哎哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b2eeddcda21d7ea73471f93e845e8aa60910ec82d98db582f099d239b42904a",
      "text": "我、我怎么可能当得了偶像呢。\n肯定是哪里搞错了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b54573a3fde6236e90d77546b1d911af8611c7e2bacab3dab00a8bb0b82bc265",
      "text": "我唱歌和跳舞都不擅长，\n更重要的是，要在人前表现自己也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ff7291040ffd78796885d9978f8e84e64c2671268f639d3c14981979a6ec75f",
      "text": "冈村直央君。\n你至今为止的表现，我都已经看过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3504e5213b14415ff0b12ecfd1a14f94c94c5c5a3a1edf6a2874fac1e0a061f",
      "text": "演技自不必说，连歌声也非常耀眼。\n我在你身上感受到了成为偶像的才能！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ad9f83b514b6d1e79fbcd6435c18e934f958deb23c6f102403868e1a2b51e50",
      "text": "怎么会，才能什么的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc81afea90e455ea2dfa822588fb7d307e933d5987608bb3cc75d7bd5a2c2a31",
      "text": "不。前几天在演播室旁听特别节目时，\n我亲眼确认过了，对此深信不疑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4af8081c2b4c222a933c71b9d111c51bc0bce0ef169af7d77013d1b471f11ff1",
      "text": "演播室旁听……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "text": "……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad50a5625f9f03223767d9d9c6be3ad7197610342e12f95498b982c4886721c7",
      "text": "直央？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6b3941c9a3d6136bb079e55a2a46b9a2d7b45587d39158853029388dd642ae0",
      "text": "（刚才好像感觉到了什么视线……错觉吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3247c7e70863f1494bc1f6de3cb24021a7bb99b8cbe40a617be35019bf8b3ac",
      "text": "（说起来，那时候\n好像也是被谁看着……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a495dba633ea4f03cc3cd39ac109d30b20ed1f6927f51dc08450228e156ee713",
      "text": "（那么，当时的视线其实就是这个人？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c006cc7df8448b3af64ff44913de2dd10f03f57542cd034406cdbb3eeab62cb",
      "text": "我看中了你的演技，还有那副歌喉，\n非常希望能和你一起工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b80ec329380c52c4c824815c96acc96b0e1899d2a7f1cd12d43735b84a04334",
      "text": "（眼神好直率……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:097c7dccfdda030b821f7f328de77eb9326a81f113e9e41a5e7428923e36e717",
      "text": "（但是，我怎么可能当得了偶像……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:236bf3cda388f24ebc2b1529d501c098b3b89f65b111f03ab00069c5604f5089",
      "text": "（连演戏的工作都会紧张，\n要是换成更引人注目的偶像，那岂不是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93b2cc07b1d9357cbb7722cd8a20a788d0874dc1b458ead1664ac14664c6ded7",
      "text": "直央……妈妈也拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9570e9353a819944f9bb1bfd20d4c85e61e7ddca832bd841605cb841ee911272",
      "text": "妈妈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72cbb42efd5c3a9b2ec2d34444379b984420c4b9b627725db3c661851492a283",
      "text": "听说那个Jupiter，\n也是315 Production旗下的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d",
      "text": "……哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e61e28b3007d3b8973ef43c30d3ec438f7db3e1d99f8269a9aea1e9001a5aa",
      "text": "Jupiter，记得是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a53c3edacb71711bc007f610481dc28b7e43072ab2409cd7e5d277637eda2f0",
      "text": "妈妈最喜欢的那组偶像？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d52dc801881c67e89a89bbb3e1342a0bbea8da32e27731e7e60087a03c789a1",
      "text": "每次听Jupiter的歌、看他们的Live，\n妈妈就会涌起勇气呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:909233e633dd9adeb0ff2b2ef855ce6a23bf5159d75dda407ad319042c4b1af6",
      "text": "如果能和他们那样的人在同一个地方工作，\n直央是不是也能对自己更有自信一些呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9570e9353a819944f9bb1bfd20d4c85e61e7ddca832bd841605cb841ee911272",
      "text": "妈妈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56c7350ae4a6e4fc3492ca0fb27e085a42d4541086586f3c9908aa97c1b553f",
      "text": "要是直央能和Jupiter同台演出的话……\n哎呀，那该怎么办才好呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38cda2fd029fd3bb9b5905a16ff512974a85d9a2ccad692b72893c610dbc1f20",
      "text": "啊、啊哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fb59b9a76f314bdccfc021beb4c0dfd43d2a969eb11a30667ce4fd3b162dcc7",
      "text": "（妈妈真的很喜欢Jupiter呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e235fee286fa39f23b44bfb50b3eb70d431c35d4ca08efb6b6c9f5a31d99a611",
      "text": "（还说过护士的工作很辛苦的时候，\n都是靠Jupiter的音乐来打起精神的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06551de7d825b8240d5e5313c40408b4d4cc741127f8920ff15465928624ebdb",
      "text": "（能给大家带来活力的，偶像吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:090077d469e2b0aac130c3db315d02d2bf29806b4c59172ea6a4a2105affb76a",
      "text": "我，真的能当得了吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9a53a0203318a401ab8d0f772b4b1cca7026d56d79ebedd4643f16343afdb87",
      "text": "当然可以。\n不，我一定会让你成为偶像的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87be535c87f6be126e0c98f25f4fadb48afb0c8873ac8d5c91894be50294662",
      "text": "哎呀，真是太令人放心了！\n直央也是这么想的吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:715a278a9c7484e6287f8a3932630725ce3af33c87bf39e7fc4cead9d4160bd7",
      "text": "（两、两个人的干劲都好足！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7bad8585c7bb6c31dad9f190fa896be8b19e14005378977ec407339b80bf6b2",
      "text": "（……明明今天心里早就决定好，\n一定要说出“我想辞职！”的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63366a6f416a31067425a48d1badf3e9cc28003554a7b3ee1518b46a2ed973c2",
      "text": "……我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef524b34234888ecbdfab38dc5b8e7b3f491273e7201dd5726b6b36975157963",
      "text": "我会去当偶像的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a611587104755b25b445ebbd20a44b6ea915784f0646900e21fa53483f447111",
      "text": "直央！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:448f0678fe1ef25eb78ed6f6336da5c521c0538ebd33231a1d363e9a733328da",
      "text": "哇哇！\n妈、妈妈！在别人面前抱过来也太……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f8780957a162b3fb5cac79e1eba0eb05c74a67f0d172ecb18e15ad8e3d5b940",
      "text": "（不过……妈妈看起来好开心。\n总觉得我也开心起来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da8f24b0babf78afefb4c77fc6505d829d138b2320bb69b6e39b07e48d5eb254",
      "text": "（好、好。既然决定要做了，\n就要全力以赴做到极限……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b06709202d60ff25fd16f3d643be9502584af2fb1021b2b44b6c2512f5378c",
      "text": "制作人！\n今后就请多多关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c83dd0e83b1020eaa9cdc40d653df4ca5fe5e49dbde4c0573e31227692b562",
      "text": "啧，今天也是群演啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3ed8cc9d49690fbc2729dccfcd728f02bb06d8d71b84c5eb0f9b14bbf1f1154",
      "text": "反正我对演艺圈也没什么兴趣就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21bdd8b4e50dfc85580b69e44dd8b322779e83b2c20df1a83106ef72ec5a48f1",
      "text": "（可我落选的试镜里拿到主角的，\n每一次都是直央！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c43271114d059d6cbbd6edf4c90845352d19a4d272e956ee4920934484001eae",
      "text": "（凭什么那种胆小鬼能……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd247e5625fede0758ac46c3a358f53e378423b78d94aa7dd7a5e375c0e9be4b",
      "text": "刚才我看到315 Pro的制作人，\n在和冈村直央的妈妈说话哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:084393cf6070ed61f27cae43f88bca011d5a349a65a1f1ea044e919d671de2ab",
      "text": "那意思是发掘他当偶像吧？\n天才童星终于要作为偶像出道了吗……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60a62acd35246881d4d28cec3cbe02a53f0d376d5d1c71f0bc03b5cf3d62e8de",
      "text": "（咦……直央要当偶像！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6efb641f3e8f6bacc54fa965f3f790afc5231acd70a5195351fe1decf1b9b79",
      "text": "喂！\n那个叫制作人的家伙在哪里！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54342fb0baebff9343b545dd8a767b5a5cece197eadbf4049882583eafd73323",
      "text": "哎？\n刚才还在这条走廊上走着呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec77a31d3f2c5ee1ff0854ba1c92a9dfa3a2e5fc672aa913467e3d0a1e03966",
      "text": "谢啦！走这边是吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ba1cf247a5452d930e61077f56f712760efd6a484134227e4244ca0b9dc85ad",
      "text": "哈、哈……在哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ada177e95124faa09817466beeec049286fb2abf32504a649c273de0f9d5649",
      "text": "（电影主角、特别节目的主持人，这次又是偶像！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:581f93449c9258be7e33488046649c196700386ee56d13bf1afddffd80c1e70f",
      "text": "可恶～……怎么好事全让那家伙占了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69656e0818ebce9a9f262469b3d21877ed9f8340e86ab026e6522b8958c00f0a",
      "text": "（偶像就是那个又唱又跳的玩意儿吧？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4383102e91ccaf084a09e2f450c2f4e90fc952b788f1412b1dcc3a5660d7d8ca",
      "text": "（比起直央那种笨手笨脚的家伙，\n我绝对能做得更好！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26c2ebc4958fbf6077e2d99a1149ed5f2611899d4816f19e2d9598f6797c4c7",
      "text": "（管他是制作人还是什么，\n我就表演给他看看！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfafcc4492a5dade513166e83bcd63b04748374465ab63d6fae6cbadb8780ba5",
      "text": "喂！你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1386b0502c0e57b58aec47b4cc7df5e47fbbd231b0b43b7131ad9d6e11b1386e",
      "text": "你知不知道那个叫什么315 Pro的\n制作人在哪里啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b86946fc7503669c5eb4d01334cb0cab5946ef65a1abe941ff3bfb3e39904f8",
      "text": "你是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a4f50ad29b027e34238cb26df6d76201fafba977dfa24bb7cbf73b778ae1b80",
      "text": "你找315 Pro的制作人，\n有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:666a993f7e6cceb00bf142380efb81f9fea56d0cf3299880107739bc2ce6738b",
      "text": "有！\n我也要参加偶像的试镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68bc8e8275dd3207ce3bc4f8579aea06559efac96ed666ca2b1371517f293097",
      "text": "原来如此……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:360daa1f68ecdfe9de7caafd76d7a80042ecd40f11c296171728646c3b61ea31",
      "text": "你要找的人，就在你面前哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7081a83f35254d611026a38ea400ea86512dbb3e1f3a3542a62685ad419c9316",
      "text": "哎！？那、你就是制作人！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30224d71f95afa967c387b6513d7bcc534c393cc15c36334b132286ff5d66c36",
      "text": "是的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74f0b70d4f9404d7d13b4076be0afdc0954c5446fd31318d1c6c421d5eeb3b87",
      "text": "（……怎么说呢，比想象中普通多了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f11f2565daaad8b210ae056708612dc0acec3995c4927c9e64d29b88c8548d",
      "text": "我叫橘志狼。11岁，小学五年级。\n拿手好戏是霹雳舞！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f67ec9c006241e29392ea50559531dc9cd5a2d52575bc3a0c01abde53c91854",
      "text": "我有信心绝对比直央更红！\n所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d12e31d61f6108668e4ba250fb2664ef277bbb67f777c76fc3cfd41e59d60e",
      "text": "让我当偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75a94f420cc8eddc232a93ea2b61cf00a4b715bf6ec93d1aad371313b4f841b9",
      "text": "“直央”是指，冈村直央君吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c8c8cd7695440502dd4ce1eeecfc03698f5f5ef82983b6b2c526b91e1f62536",
      "text": "对！我的舞跳得比他还好！\n看好了，我要跳了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bccd6195d23f1a59101b90f0325fd3004134534f7eab8e364fa931f6592cb3d4",
      "text": "哎！？在这里！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3859cdadf62d93bbbf6e2cc0e0277e3b048f9a40ed9aa6b9b49d96340a04dd32",
      "text": "欧拉、欧拉、欧拉欧拉、欧拉啊啊啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9d33c1556e2e5ea15cee29d38372b407822d0ee335e6a715e03f2ebb491d60f",
      "text": "嘿嘿……怎么样！\n厉害吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edbd605ccfbffb272a20a0fee11048719496a8d39a23d6004c57d5c029f5b93b",
      "text": "喂、喂……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c07825953d2c70542ab5d81cba9698961c279e937468ec5b31706ca1764d6f5",
      "text": "（糟啦！是不是太突然了！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b09101d3ee5fb69be15ee5d33d369340304f5811936af033bcd47c76856d40a2",
      "text": "……果然，和我料想的一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:435eaa5998cbb9a17c8f766667f629855f667f3340f60795adf445b680705319",
      "text": "我一直在找你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b46185f8b008a78de6081329e4bf8e7f15e2504bdba41c2c4851336671a03b15",
      "text": "……找我？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c240998e8a00e22e455b1f638157f2a65b2a32a89b52d2a335b03248c8a9eac",
      "text": "去节目现场旁听时，\n你的舞蹈一下子就闯进了我的视线。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f57f99e3844beb0e4869fb485a41e9ec6d365b91b9ef1f7270558fab90bce74",
      "text": "不仅是舞蹈，\n你的热情和胆魄也让我深深感动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2baaa230cfd3bc1cbd13c5b79fbbc5bf3f9c87840a96fe3494d95ac9b3a2dede",
      "text": "这么说，我……能当偶像了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f5733b2eb0201df6402404f18046d4fef655c3558b45a85f7f66324888e1a6",
      "text": "首先，在和你父母商量的前提下，\n如果能一起工作就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5c5b0fc636f8cf099960bd901b17a0e0423131191cccb6818b1c84dea2a9733",
      "text": "我把名片给你，\n可以的话请联系我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcbfed5bcd787bb04dc98df3f550ef4bc1831c112bb29e425f9c0b1934705c0e",
      "text": "（这个人，看到了我的舞蹈啊。\n而且还使劲夸了我……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db870ffa612c33b48786cd407434d2fed0608072dc29b2de6ad32e02e70f2e74",
      "text": "只要跟老妈他们说一声就行了吧？\n我知道了，一定会联系你的，你就等着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e2c13d494984f7a0cb89e6832a52cb359b2ab1324f0ea1f675c2d81e4b5fef1",
      "text": "再见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5180ef55e102d3d1b0d7aaa2ed4a5e2e29c76a89d42dc00bfb56491f53297cd7",
      "text": "……没想到，他居然会主动找上门来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_02_1_1_011_02:1_1_011_02_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:251341bc571dcc35208e62effa19e09654d73f9bf8e9e1030f864779bf6042c7",
      "text": "剩下的就是姬野花音君了……\n首先，试着联系一下他的父亲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
